From: ObeseCatLord <6099645+ObeseCatLord@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 14:46:52 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] rendering above 4x (experimental): jittered GS instances
 interleaved to 8x

GA2_PGS_JITTER=1 with GA2_PGS_SSAA=16 on the desktop: three more GS instances moved by half an internal pixel; their vsync runs on worker threads; the presentation interleaves the four frames into an 8x picture. Off by default (docs/rendering/above-4x.md: in 3D it costs about half the frame rate for slightly cleaner edges at 4K).
